  {
   "id": 517027,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/e4ae0e47fe751fc9.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Sasanami T, et al./Europe PMC)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n",
   "stem_html": "<p>The image shows the reproductive system of a female bird.</p>\n<p>Which option describes how the egg is deposited outside?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1011182,
     "content_html": "The egg is deposited outside from the vaginal opening."
    },
    {
     "id": 1011183,
     "content_html": "The egg is passed to the cloaca and is deposited from the cloacal opening."
    },
    {
     "id": 1011184,
     "content_html": "The egg is kept in side until it hatches. The bird gives live birth from the vaginal opening."
    },
    {
     "id": 1011185,
     "content_html": "The egg is kept in side until it hatches. The offpsring passes to cloaca and the bird  gives live birth through the cloacal opening."
    }
